# Local Claude Code state — permission allowlists and machine-specific paths.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Agent operating notes. Kept local rather than published: they are working
# instructions for whoever's agent is driving this repo, not documentation the
# project owes its readers. Human-facing equivalents live in CONTRIBUTING.md and
# docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# Planning and design notes are never published — a rule, not a case-by-case
# call. They describe work that does not exist yet, so a reader finding one in
# `docs/` reasonably mistakes it for a description of the app, and they tend to
# reference other unshipped projects: `QUICK_CAPTURE_PLAN.md` detailed a separate
# unpublished app down to its type names. Keep them on disk, out of the repo.
*_PLAN.md
*-PLAN.md
*_plan.md
*-plan.md
PLAN.md
ROADMAP.md
docs/plans/
docs/planning/

# The release checklist is process, not product — and it records certificate
# details, go-public steps and the state of this specific machine. Kept local.
docs/RELEASING.md

# Release artefacts built by `make dmg`.
dist/
*.dmg
